// Title: Powershell Local Email Collection
// ID: 2837e152-93c8-43d2-85ba-c3cd3c2ae614
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: frack113
// Date: 2021-07-21
// Tags: attack.collection, attack.t1114.001
// Description: Adversaries may target user email on local systems to collect sensitive information.
// Files containing email data can be acquired from a users local system, such as Outlook storage or cache files.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

_sourceCategory=* | where ((ScriptBlockText matches "*Get-Inbox.ps1*" or ScriptBlockText matches "*Microsoft.Office.Interop.Outlook*" or ScriptBlockText matches "*Microsoft.Office.Interop.Outlook.olDefaultFolders*" or ScriptBlockText matches "*-comobject outlook.application*"))
